msgctxt "76"
msgid "Phew, nothing like a nice, refreshing bath!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Oh, hi, Uncle Kaz. Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "It's Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Ayako-chan? What about her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Hmm. I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's great that she puts so much effort into making\r\n"
"sure everyone else is okay, but I'm honestly kinda worried\r\n"
"she's not taking care of herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Huh? Why do you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Not sure. It's just the impression I get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "...Honestly, I've kinda been feeling the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I'm sure Ayako-chan thinks she has to take care of everyone\r\n"
"else since she's older than they are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "She almost treats it like some kind of job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I keep offering help, too, but she turns me down flat every\r\n"
"time. Plus..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Plus what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I think the other kids ask her for stuff they're too afraid\r\n"
"to ask me for. They probably think I'd get mad at them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"And Ayako-chan's so nice that she can't say no, no matter\r\n"
"what they ask for. She barely thinks of herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yeah, I think you're right..."
msgstr ""

